OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween superfan turns semi into
OL,4,Ahaunted house
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the sun sets on Hob Moor Road in
OL,7,FYardley, the monsters, skeletons,
OL,8,Fvampires and werewolves have woken up
OL,9,Fand a long queue has started to form.
OL,11,FThrill seekers are all here to see
OL,12,FDarren Mackenzie and Karen Pearce's
OL,13,Fsemi-detached home, which has been
OL,14,Ftransformed into a Halloween haunted
OL,15,Fhouse.
OL,17,FKaren said it all started at last
OL,18,FOctober when her partner, Darren,
OL,19,Fdecorated the outside of their house,
OL,20,Fand "it's gone crazy ever since".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
